# SoundPlant demo: pop, 116 BPM, E major. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A bright radio pop song in E major, 116 bars. A syncopated digi-pluck earworm previews alone in the intro and owns the
# post-chorus. The verses circle C#m7 Amaj7 F#m7 B7sus4 and never touch the tonic; the pre climbs A B C#m B/D# to the
# dominant; the chorus (E B/D# C#m A, E B/D# A D) is a singable vocal line over a bouncing bass. The half-time bridge
# (A E/G# F#m7 B) ends in one beat of near silence, a rebuild leans on C7, and the conductor lifts the last chorus a
# semitone to F. The outro quotes the pluck, slowed, over the pad.
# T1 kit  T2 knit finger bass  T3 sample piano  T4 voile vocal lead (the hook)  T5 jacquard digi pluck (the earworm)
# T6 jacquard spiral pad  T7 rayon glass bell  T8 voile vocal chop
# Song: intro 8, verse 8, pre 4, chorus 8, post-chorus 8, verse 2 8, pre 4, chorus 8, post-chorus 8, bridge 8, rebuild 4,
# last chorus 16 (+1), post-chorus 8, outro 16.
bpm 116
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 4
knob 9 e3 0

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a clean punchy kick, a snare with a clap layered on it, tight hats, a shaker, toms for the fills
knob 1 d1.k1 60
knob 1 d1.k2 62
knob 1 d1.k3 86
knob 1 d1.k4 56
knob 1 d1.volume 92
knob 1 d2.k1 66
knob 1 d2.k2 90
knob 1 d2.k3 90
knob 1 d2.k4 96
knob 1 d2.volume 90
knob 1 d2.send2 70
knob 1 d5.k4 60
knob 1 d5.volume 74
knob 1 d5.send2 56
knob 1 d3.volume 42
knob 1 d4.volume 40
knob 1 d4.send2 22
knob 1 d9.volume 42
knob 1 d9.send1 12
knob 1 d8.volume 40
knob 1 d8.send2 30
knob 1 d6.volume 54
knob 1 d7.volume 52
knob 1 level 90
# T2 a knit finger bass: round and close to the kick
preset 2 finger_bass knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 74
knob 2 level 88
# T3 a sample piano: the chords, bright in the choruses
preset 3 piano sample
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 level 92
knob 3 pan 50
knob 3 send1 10
knob 3 send2 26
# T4 a voile vocal lead: the voice of the song, in the echo and the hall
preset 4 vocal_lead voile
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 108
knob 4 pan 62
knob 4 send1 28
knob 4 send2 36
# T5 a jacquard digi pluck: the earworm, bright and a little to the right, in the echo
preset 5 digi_pluck jacquard
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 level 104
knob 5 pan 84
knob 5 send1 38
knob 5 send2 24
# T6 a jacquard spiral pad: a single-voice texture on filter locks, pumped by the kit
preset 6 spiral_pad jacquard
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 ltype pump
knob 6 lspeed track_1
knob 6 lamt 34
knob 6 level 72
knob 6 pan 30
knob 6 send2 60
# T7 a rayon glass bell: glints and risers in the echo and the hall
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 72
knob 7 pan 100
knob 7 send1 50
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 a voile vocal chop: short sung syllables on the off-beats
preset 8 vocal_chop voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 level 98
knob 8 pan 38
knob 8 send1 24
knob 8 send2 44
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 46
knob 11 e4 44
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 72
knob 12 e3 54
mst lo 58
mst hi 60
mst comp 42
mst pump 18
mst pumpby kick
mst release 70
mst level 104

