# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro A: the pluck teases its first notes alone, the pad and the bell
scenedef 1 1 6 1 8 2 8 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 xx.x...x..
# intro B: the earworm in full, a quiet piano, the kit comes in
scenedef 2 1 6 1 8 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 .x.x...x..
# verse A: C#m7 Amaj7 F#m7 B7sus4, the tonic never sung
scenedef 3 2 1 3 1 3 2 2 6 1 1
scenemute 3 ......xx..
# verse B: the same, the last chord F#7 leans into the pre, the bell joins
scenedef 4 2 2 3 1 3 2 2 6 1 1
scenemute 4 .......x..
# pre: A B C#m B/D#, the bass climbs to the leading tone, the kit builds
scenedef 5 3 3 5 3 3 3 3 4 1 2
scenemute 5 ....x.....
# chorus A: E B/D# C#m A, the tune over a bouncing bass
scenedef 6 4 4 6 4 4 4 4 2 1 1
scenemute 6 ..........
# chorus B: E B/D# A D, the D falls into the post-chorus, a fill
scenedef 7 5 5 6 4 4 4 4 2 1 1
scenemute 7 ..........
# post-chorus A: E A E A, the earworm
scenedef 8 6 6 2 8 1 1 5 1 1 1
scenemute 8 ...x......
# post-chorus B: the earworm again
scenedef 9 6 6 2 8 1 1 5 1 1 1
scenemute 9 ...x......
# verse 2 A: C#m9 Amaj7 F#m9 B7sus4, the ninth leaning in
scenedef 10 2 1 4 2 3 2 2 6 1 1
scenemute 10 ......x...
# verse 2 B: F#m7b5 borrowed under the line, F#7 into the pre
scenedef 11 2 2 4 2 3 2 2 6 1 1
scenemute 11 ..........
# pre 2: the climb again
scenedef 12 3 3 5 3 3 3 3 4 1 2
scenemute 12 ....x.....
# chorus 2 A: the tune again
scenedef 13 4 4 6 4 4 4 4 2 1 1
scenemute 13 ..........
# chorus 2 B: the D falls into the post-chorus
scenedef 14 5 5 6 4 4 4 4 2 1 1
scenemute 14 ..........
# post-chorus 2 A: the earworm
scenedef 15 6 6 2 8 1 1 5 1 1 1
scenemute 15 ...x......
# post-chorus 2 B: into the bridge
scenedef 16 6 6 2 8 1 1 5 1 1 1
scenemute 16 ...x......
# bridge A: half time, A E/G# F#m7 B, a long vocal line
scenedef 17 7 7 7 6 5 5 6 5 1 1
scenemute 17 .......x..
# bridge B: the line climbs to the high D#, then one beat of near silence
scenedef 18 7 7 7 6 5 5 6 5 1 5
scenemute 18 ..........
# rebuild: A B C#m then C7, the earworm speeds up, the kit builds
scenedef 19 3 8 8 7 6 6 7 7 1 3
scenemute 19 ..........
knob 9 e3 9
# last chorus A, one semitone up in F: the tune lifted an octave on the peaks
scenedef 20 8 4 6 5 4 4 8 3 2 1
scenemute 20 ..........
# last chorus B: the D falls home
scenedef 21 8 5 6 5 4 4 8 3 2 1
scenemute 21 ..........
# last chorus C: the tune again, the chops answering twice a bar
scenedef 22 8 4 6 5 4 4 8 3 2 1
scenemute 22 ..........
# last chorus D: a fill into the post-chorus
scenedef 23 5 5 6 5 4 4 8 3 2 1
scenemute 23 ..........
# post-chorus 3 A: the earworm in F
scenedef 24 6 6 2 8 1 1 5 1 2 1
scenemute 24 ...x......
# post-chorus 3 B: the earworm in F
scenedef 25 6 6 2 8 1 1 5 1 2 1
scenemute 25 ...x......
# outro A: the groove thins, the earworm quoted, a descant above
scenedef 26 1 6 1 8 1 1 5 1 2 1
scenemute 26 ..........
# outro B: no drums, the pluck slowed, a descant over the piano
scenedef 27 1 6 1 8 7 7 5 1 2 1
scenemute 27 xx.....x..
# outro C: the descant is gone, the piano, the pluck and the pad
scenedef 28 1 6 1 8 7 7 5 1 2 1
scenemute 28 xx.x...x..
# outro D: the pluck ends on the tonic, the pad rings out
scenedef 29 1 6 1 8 7 7 5 1 2 1
scenemute 29 xxxx...x..
knob 9 e3 0
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:4 7:4 8:4 9:4 10:4 11:4 12:4 13:4 14:4 15:4 16:4 17:4 18:4 19:4 20:4 21:4 22:4 23:4 24:4 25:4 26:4 27:4 28:4 29:4
songloop 0
expect lanes <65

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_pop.wav
tap PLAY
bars 116
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
